RPG Main Book p.153', 'Palladium Fantasy RPG Main Book p.153-155', 'Palladium Fantasy RPG Main Book p.155', 'Revised Heroes Unlimited p.104');
SELECT 'the spell rows, part 3: 9 rows are in and cite their book' AS assertion, count(*) AS got, 9 AS want
